@startuml order-logistics

title Order - 物流選擇流程

actor User
participant "Browser" as Browser
participant "API\n(Endpoint)" as API
participant "Handler\n(Use Case)" as Handler
participant "Redis\n(ICacher)" as Redis
participant "ECPay\nLogistics" as ECPay

== 發起物流選擇 ==

User -> API : POST /orders/logistics/start\n{ receiverName, receiverPhone, goodsAmount }
API -> Handler : StartLogisticsSelectionCommand(userId)
Handler -> Redis : SetAsync(session:{token} → userId, TTL 15min)
Handler --> API : { token }
API -> ECPay : GetSelectionFormHtmlAsync\n(clientReplyUrl = /ecpay/client-reply?token=xxx)
ECPay --> API : HTML form
API --> Browser : 200 text/html

== 使用者選擇門市 ==

Browser -> ECPay : 整頁導向 ECPay 門市選擇頁
User -> ECPay : 選擇門市
ECPay -> API : POST /ecpay/client-reply?token=xxx\n(browser POST, FormData: ResultData)
API -> Redis : GetAsync(session:{token}) → userId
API -> ECPay : DecryptClientReply(ResultData)
API -> Redis : SetAsync(logistics:{userId} → LogisticsCacheData, TTL 15min)
API -> Redis : RemoveAsync(session:{token})
note right: token 一次性使用，防止重播攻擊
API --> Browser : 302 Redirect → {FrontendDomain}/checkout?logistics=done

== 前端查詢物流狀態 ==

Browser -> API : GET /orders/logistics/status
API -> Redis : GetAsync(logistics:{userId})
Redis --> API : LogisticsCacheData
API --> Browser : 200 { isReady: true, logisticsSubType, storeName/address }

@enduml
